# Cavernous Maws (WotG 1) with Cait Sith current: the maw's own script (xi.maws.onTrigger) plays 500 with bit 0, the
# same packet as the mission's 500 in the main trace; its finish changes nothing.
lists BatalliaDowns/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger BatalliaDowns/onEventFinish/500 RolanberryFields/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFields/onEventFinish/500 SauromugueChampaign/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger SauromugueChampaign/onEventFinish/500
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg CaitSith current
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # xi.maws' own 500
finish-if-event
